ignature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1001-timecrafter","name":"Timecrafter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1001_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-09T18:50:45-07:00","id":1454630,"title":"","content":"c) Wouldn't it be better to use Transmutation an put a lot of restrictions and some tags to transform it in an attack? \ud83e\udd14","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1001-timecrafter","name":"Timecrafter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1001_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-09T20:11:54-07:00","id":1454634,"title":"","content":"a) Depends on how you describe the power. I'd say they stick around until they'd have a mechanical effect you didn't pay for (like you tried to pick one up and use it as a sword for example)<br /> <br /> b) Does it stay? Sure, it's probably scattered around. Does it cause hail? Probably not unless you also have Quantum Anima to create a complication from the hail. Remember, quantum powers do not follow the laws of physics.<br /> <br /> c) That would be a really complicated way to do it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-07-10T01:56:22-07:00","id":1454647,"title":"","content":"The ice does remain but, from a gaming standpoint, they are far less dangerous since you would have to pick it up and throw it by hand. Whereas, when you make it and direct it, it is coming at you much faster and in greater quantities. Such as, if you make something out of ice like a cage and someone breaks free, the ice is still there but it is not structural anymore.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}